sequenceDiagram
    actor HR
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (Express)
    participant DB as Database (Aiven MySQL via Prisma)
    participant Mail as Email Service

    Note over HR,DB: Viewing what needs follow-up
    HR->>FE: Open Follow Ups page
    FE->>BE: GET /api/follow-ups
    BE->>DB: findMany applications awaiting feedback past due date, or candidates awaiting response
    BE-->>FE: 200 grouped list (overdue feedback, pending candidate replies)

    Note over HR,Mail: Send an interviewer a feedback reminder
    HR->>FE: Click "Remind" next to an overdue interview
    FE->>BE: POST /api/follow-ups/feedback-reminder {interviewId}
    BE->>DB: Verify interview exists and feedback is still missing
    alt feedback already submitted
        BE-->>FE: 400 "Feedback has already been submitted"
    else still missing
        BE->>Mail: sendFeedbackReminder(interviewer email)
        BE->>DB: writeAuditLog(FEEDBACK_REMINDER_SENT)
        BE-->>FE: 200 sent
    end

    Note over HR,Mail: Send a candidate an invite / follow-up email
    HR->>FE: Click "Send Invite" for a shortlisted candidate
    FE->>BE: POST /api/follow-ups/candidate-invite {candidateId, vacancyId}
    BE->>DB: Verify candidate application is in an appropriate stage
    BE->>Mail: sendCandidateInvite(candidate email, vacancy details)
    BE->>DB: writeAuditLog(CANDIDATE_INVITE_SENT)
    BE-->>FE: 200 sent
